  "transformations": [
    "Converted body storage from array-of-structs to structure-of-arrays (SoA)",
    "Added a single #pragma omp parallel region per simulation iteration, with #pragma omp for schedule(static) for both force computation and position update",
    "Manually unrolled the inner j-loop by a factor of 4 while preserving exact summation order",
    "Added restrict qualifiers to pointer parameters in body_force and write_dataset",
    "Used 1.0f / sqrt(sqrd_dist) instead of integer division"
  ]
